# Phase 4 pre-push hook (runs once per push, ~4s).
# Catches client jest regressions before they reach origin / CI.
# Skip via `git push --no-verify` only when explicitly intentional.
#
# Why pre-push not pre-commit: per docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-01-dev-pipeline-design.md
# Tier 3 #3 — pre-commit hooks fire too often and tend to get --no-verify'd in
# practice. Pre-push is cheap enough not to.
#
# Server jest is intentionally NOT run here (would add ~22s).
# Server work is gated by CI (.github/workflows/test.yml) on push.

npm test
